<cit><quote><hi rendition="#c">Ueber Phil. 2, 5 &#x2014; 11.</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#fr">Ein ieglicher &#x017F;ey ge&#x017F;innet, wie Je&#x017F;us Chri&#x017F;tus<lb/>
